{"activity_text": "Anti-Gram-", "article_id": "", "assay_text": "Unknown", "assay_type": "", "comments_text": "Sequence analysis: APD analysis reveals that this sequence is similar (93.33%) to CATH-2(1-15) R: 33%, F: 20%, I=K: 13%. Activity: active against E. coli ATCC 8739 or 6 resistant E strains (MIC 0.5-16 ug/ml). Warning: other bacteria not tested. In vitro toxicity: chicken RBC: 30% hemolysis at 64 ug/ml. At this concentration, 40% chicken kidney cells survived.", "concentration": "", "cytotoxicity_text": "", "hemolytic_activity_text": "", "measure_group": "", "measure_value": "", "pubmed_id": "38812753", "record_granularity": "entry_text", "reference_text": "Front Cell Infect Microbiol. 2024 May 15;14:1390934. doi: 10.3389/fcimb.2024.1390934. PubMed", "sequence_key": "APD6:AP04576", "source_id": "AP04576", "source_numeric_id": "04576", "source_path": "APD6/apd6_export/structured/peptides.csv", "source_record_id": "AP04576", "source_table": "peptides.csv", "stability_text": "", "subject_name": "", "target_organism_text": "", "title": "CATH-2-derived antimicrobial peptide inhibits multidrug-resistant Escherichia coli infection in chickens.", "unit": "", "﻿database": "APD6"}
{"activity_text": "Anti-Gram-", "article_id": "", "assay_text": "Unknown", "assay_type": "", "comments_text": "Sequence analysis: APD analysis reveals that this sequence is similar (86.67%) to CATH-2(1-15) R: 40%, F=I=K: 13%. FRP segment was repalced by MRL. Activity: active against E. coli ATCC 8739 or 6 resistant E strains (MIC 2-8 ug/ml). Warning: other bacteria not tested. In vitro toxicity: chicken RBC: ~10% hemolysis at 64 ug/ml (slightly hemo.lytic). At this concentration, nearly all chicken kidney cells survived. Animal model:chicken: 21-day-old infected with E. coli via the pectoral muscle, 4h later, treated via the same route. Showed efficacy (treatment 70% survial vs. 30% survival no treatment; and CFU drop in organs such as liver, heart, and spleen). This peptide may be utilized to treat avian colibacillosis caused by E. coli.", "concentration": "", "cytotoxicity_text": "", "hemolytic_activity_text": "", "measure_group": "", "measure_value": "", "pubmed_id": "38812753", "record_granularity": "entry_text", "reference_text": "Front Cell Infect Microbiol. 2024 May 15;14:1390934. doi: 10.3389/fcimb.2024.1390934. PubMed", "sequence_key": "APD6:AP04577", "source_id": "AP04577", "source_numeric_id": "04577", "source_path": "APD6/apd6_export/structured/peptides.csv", "source_record_id": "AP04577", "source_table": "peptides.csv", "stability_text": "", "subject_name": "", "target_organism_text": "", "title": "CATH-2-derived antimicrobial peptide inhibits multidrug-resistant Escherichia coli infection in chickens.", "unit": "", "﻿database": "APD6"}
